# API_URL — the deployed API's URL.
#
# In production this is a RUNTIME variable: set it in the Dockhold dashboard
# (Variables) and restart the app. No rebuild, no commit — it's injected into
# the page when the container starts (see entrypoint.sh).
#
#   API_URL=https://fullstack-api-xxxx.dockhold.app
#
# For local dev, set it in public/config.js instead (window.__APP_CONFIG__).
